":null,"path_picks":[],"path_why":"No pathway map has been read for this program.","picks":[],"total":{"max":31,"min":29.5},"up_to":0.0},"gaps":[{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The page covers both the Certificate of Achievement and the A.S. in Medical Assisting; the Program Requirements course list is the certificate''s requirement (the A.S. adds A&P 120, electives and GE). The Program Student Learning Outcomes are printed once for the program as a whole and are recorded here as shared by the certificate.","where":"Cerritos College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The elective block''s rule is ambiguous: the text says to add classes ''to complete a minimum of 29 units'' and prints 3.0-3.5 beside it. Minimum 3 is taken from the printed low end of that block total (in effect one course); with the 26.5-27.5 subtotal, the 29-unit floor alone would require only 1.5-2.5 more units.","where":"Cerritos College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"MA 68 row prints 3.0-4.0 units; the ''or MA 73'' and ''or MA 74'' alternative rows print no units, so their units are left null (the state file stores 3 and 4).","where":"Cerritos College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"PSYC 150 alternative row prints no units; left null.","where":"Cerritos College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Footnote 1 on MA 68: students select only one of MA 68, MA 73 or MA 74 based on current medical office employment; the course may not be repeated more than one time.","where":"Cerritos College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The certificate requires a grade of C or better in all required medical assisting courses, and twelve units must have been taken within the last five years.","where":"Cerritos College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The Academic Requirement paragraph refers to an ''Associate of Arts'' while the rest of the page says Associate of Science; possible catalog inconsistency.","where":"Cerritos College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The recommended semester sequence mentions ''PSYC C1000 or PSYC 150, or equivalent''; the ''or equivalent'' does not appear in the requirements table.","where":"Cerritos College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"}],"map":{"checked_run":"census-20261004T152831Z-s3of4","host":null,"status":"none","text":"The weekly census found no published term-by-term program map on Cerritos College''s site (census run census-20261004T152831Z-s3of4).","url":null},"v":1}'::jsonb from public.program_requirement_records r where r.college = 'Cerritos College' and r.control_number = '20512' on conflict (college, control_number) do update set display = excluded.display;
