":[{"kind":"Catalog and state file differ","owner":"college","text":"The catalog prints DNCE 2B, DNCE 11A, KINF 19 for this program; the state''s Program Course File does not list them.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s program record in the state''s curriculum inventory"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The catalog text prints no units beside individual courses; only block totals (Core Courses 14, List A 6, Movement ''Minimum of three units'') and the major total (20-24) are printed, so course units are null.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Movement Based Course List rule: ''Choose a maximum of one course from any three of the following areas: Aquatics, Combative, Dance, Fitness, Individual Sports, Team Sports'' with ''Minimum of three units''. Recorded as one choose_courses block (minimum 3) listing each course once in order of first appearance; the one-course-per-area, three-different-areas constraint is not captured by the block structure. Many courses appear under more than one area (e.g., KINA 8A/8B/8C in Aquatics, Fitness and Individual Sports; DNCE 40 in Dance and Fitness; several KINI courses in Combatives and Team Sports; KINS 24A/B/C in Individual and Team Sports).","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Area membership: Aquatics = KINA 8A, 8B, 8C, 20; Combatives = KINI 25, 27A, 27B, 29, 30A, 30B, 31A, 31B, 34, 37A, 37B, 37C; Dance = DNCE 1, 2A, 2B, 8, 10, 11A, 11B, 12A, 12B, 14A, 14B, 17, 18A, 18B, 28, 29, 30, 31, 32, 36, 39, 40; Fitness = DNCE 40, 41, 42, 43, KINA 8A, 8B, 8C, 20, KINF 10A, 10B, 19, 25, 34A, 34B, 36A, 36B, 38A, 38B, KINI 29, 33A, 33B, 37A, 50A, 50B, KINL 2, 18; Individual Sports = KINA 8A, 8B, 8C, KINI 4A, 4B, 4C, 18A, 18B, 18C, 33A, 40A, 40B, 40C, 50A, 50B, KINS 24A, 24B, 24C, KINX 19; Team Sports = KINA 14, KINI 4A, 4B, 18A, 18B, 25, 27A, 27B, 30A, 30B, 31A, 31B, 37A, 37B, 40A, 40B, KINS 2A, 2B, 10A, 10B, 12A, 12B, 16A, 16B, 24A, 24B, 24C, 26A, 26B.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The ''Minimum of three units'' movement requirement may conflict with closed-list units of 0.5 per activity course (three courses would total 1.5); reviewer should verify course units and whether the rule is better read as choose_units 3.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Movement block stated recorded as min 3, max null because the catalog prints ''Minimum of three units''.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Closed-list codes written without a space (DNCE18A, DNCE32, ECON17, KIN5) were matched to catalog codes DNCE 18A, DNCE 32, ECON 17, KIN 5 and not marked as additions.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"DNCE 2B, DNCE 11A and KINF 19 appear in the catalog''s movement list but are not in the closed list; marked catalog_addition true.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Title differences: catalog prints KIN 3 as ''Basic First Aid and CPR'' (closed list ''First Aid & CPR''), DNCE 40 as ''Conditioning Through Dance'' (closed list ''Condition Through Dance''), KINI 29 as ''Self Defense and Martial Arts''.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The outcomes tab prints a ''Program Learning Outcomes'' heading with only a link (''Review Student Learning Outcomes (SLOs) for this program.'') and no outcomes text; outcomes left empty.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner"