nly block totals (Core Courses 10; List A, B, C 3-4 each); no units are printed beside individual courses, so every course units field is null.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"List B reads ''Choose 3 units from the following or any course not already used from List A''; List C reads ''Choose 3 units from the following or any course not already used from List A or List B''. Those List A/B courses are not repeated in the List B/C blocks.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Closed-list codes ECON17, HIST31 and ARTH11H (no space) were matched to the catalog''s ECON 17, HIST 31 and ARTH 11H and marked catalog_addition false.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"ARTH 11, ARTH 12, ARTH 12H appear to correspond to closed-list AHIS 11, AHIS 12, AHIS 12H; ECON C2002/C2002H to BUSC 1A/1AH; HIST C1001/C1001H and HIST C1002/C1002H to HIST 7/7H and HIST 8/8H. Recorded as catalog additions since codes differ; reviewer should confirm renumbering.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"In List A, ECON 17 is printed with ''or'' alternatives PSYC 10, SOC 23, STAT C1000, STAT C1000H as one statistics choice; PSYC 3 in List B has alternatives PSYC 3H and SOC 12.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Some catalog titles differ from the closed list (e.g., HIST 9 ''History of Asian Americans and Pacific Islanders'', HIST 30 ''History of African Americans, 1619-1877'').","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The Outcomes tab prints the heading ''Program Learning Outcomes'' and only a link (''Review Student Learning Outcomes (SLOs) for this program.''); no outcomes are printed, so outcomes are empty.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Degree total is 60 units with 34 Cal-GETC units; total_units records the major (19-22). Footnote: courses may be double-counted for the major and Cal-GETC.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"}],"map":{"checked_run":"census-20261004T152834Z-s2of4","host":null,"status":"none","text":"The weekly census found no published term-by-term program map on Mt. San Antonio College''s site (census run census-20261004T152834Z-s2of4).","url":null},"v":1}'::jsonb from public.program_requirement_records r where r.college = 'Mt. San Antonio College' and r.control_number = '39842' on conflict (college, control_number) do update set display = excluded.display;
